  clock: 5  # 195d
  nonce: 195d  # 195d
  message: "REFRAMED (2026-06-18 cost interview). REJECT the full 312-cell enforced applicability matrix: upfront cost is dominated by adjudicating ~194 empty cells (most legitimately empty), and an enforced expected/forbidden matrix carries irreducible false-positive risk (paid in human trust + CI-signal erosion) that cheap agent labor does NOT remove. Sound, cheaper design = POPULATION RATCHET: auto-snapshot the (kind,field) cells populated above a threshold, assert in CI they never drop to null — sound by construction (no subjective judgments), catches the load-bearing regression class (WI-lisog fingerprint-on-method), regenerated on intentional population changes. Empty-cell discovery stays with dogfooding. BUILD DEFERRED per Zeno-scope decision — not Wave 2; pick up as a scoped ratchet item later. Downgraded todo_hard -> todo_soft."  # 195d
